  "notes": "Re-split from 3_33-36_r97, 3_37-39_r97 (reviewed): the audit found no clean audio cut at the old edge. Chapters, glosses and motifs are unchanged. STAGING v4: 33-34 (Allah's choosing) and 35-36 (the vow, the pregnancy and the birth: the wife of Imran is never drawn, a private matter) stay ambient as they were. 37: her place of worship (Al-Muyassar: Zakariya settled her in his place of worship; As-Sa'di: her mihrab, her place of prayer) drawn as a prayer hall. Maryam is only the green drop «مريم», Zakariya only the blue drop «زكريا»: he appears on «وكفلها», moves toward her on «دخل عليها», asks on «قال» and she answers on «قالت». The provision is never drawn (no food): only a sparkle on her drop and a light plate. Seal plate for the acceptance. Wide shots only, no close-up or pan on the drops."
